{"1403110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Primeval", "steam_appid": 1403110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primeval: A Persistent Prehistoric Sandbox</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 67+ dinosaur and prehistoric species — from hatchling to apex predator — solo, or on servers holding up to 150 players, with progress that carries over between both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One World, Two Ways to Play</strong><br>Grow a hatchling to adulthood safely in single-player, then bring that same creature onto a 150-player server to hunt, defend territory, and build a legacy. Retreat back to single-player any time for a session with zero lag and zero raids. Growth, talents, and stats carry over either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Life Cycle</strong><br>Start as a vulnerable hatchling and grow into an apex predator, earning evolution points to unlock talents and traits that shape how your creature plays. Build nests, gather resources to strengthen your brood, and hatch the next generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinated Pack and Herd AI</strong><br>Herbivores form defensive herds. Predators hunt in coordinated packs. It's not a world of animals wandering in circles — creatures work together, the way they would have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>67+ Playable Species</strong><br>More species than any other dinosaur survival game, spanning land, sea, and sky:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apex Carnivores: Giganotosaurus, Spinosaurus, Allosaurus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavyweight Herbivores: Argentinosaurus, Triceratops, Ankylosaurus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marine &amp; Aerial Terrors: Megalodon, Tylosaurus, Quetzalcoatlus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Prehistoric Wonders: Anomalocaris, Titanoboa, Dunkleosteus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built by One Developer</strong><br>Primeval is built and maintained by a single developer, with regular updates adding new species and mechanics.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primeval: A Persistent Prehistoric Sandbox</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of 67+ dinosaur and prehistoric species — from hatchling to apex predator — solo, or on servers holding up to 150 players, with progress that carries over between both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One World, Two Ways to Play</strong><br>Grow a hatchling to adulthood safely in single-player, then bring that same creature onto a 150-player server to hunt, defend territory, and build a legacy. Retreat back to single-player any time for a session with zero lag and zero raids. Growth, talents, and stats carry over either way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Full Life Cycle</strong><br>Start as a vulnerable hatchling and grow into an apex predator, earning evolution points to unlock talents and traits that shape how your creature plays. Build nests, gather resources to strengthen your brood, and hatch the next generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordinated Pack and Herd AI</strong><br>Herbivores form defensive herds. Predators hunt in coordinated packs. It's not a world of animals wandering in circles — creatures work together, the way they would have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>67+ Playable Species</strong><br>More species than any other dinosaur survival game, spanning land, sea, and sky:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apex Carnivores: Giganotosaurus, Spinosaurus, Allosaurus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavyweight Herbivores: Argentinosaurus, Triceratops, Ankylosaurus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marine &amp; Aerial Terrors: Megalodon, Tylosaurus, Quetzalcoatlus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Prehistoric Wonders: Anomalocaris, Titanoboa, Dunkleosteus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built by One Developer</strong><br>Primeval is built and maintained by a single developer, with regular updates adding new species and mechanics.</p>", "short_description": "Grow a dinosaur from hatchling to full-grown adult, then take it anywhere — solo or into 150-player servers, with everything you've earned carried over. 67+ playable species, from land to sea to sky.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/037af38ff91baf0dec49430c1daf71a93a0d3065/header.jpg?t=1784765894", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/8ee82968aecec7b56b1f8a0b3efa9f9a1cdd8d6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784765894", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403110/8ee82968aecec7b56b1f8a0b3efa9f9a1cdd8d6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784765894", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 3.0 GHz or faster.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 or AMD Radeon R9 280X series card or higher.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> * Broadband internet connection required for multiplayer-mode, not required for singleplayer-mode.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 3.4 GHz or faster.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N